lock of code moves to the end of ParseArgs (old line 554)"],["2e5cef90_dc0dd6c0",58,-1,0,"Is there perhaps a way to query this severity without triggering the slowdown? If so, we could warn if the -Wno-error flags were not as expected, as the wrong severity would occur."]],0,175],[7143921,20411,143,3.856,3.092,[[87,0]],[["01c2d99e_5a8b20d6",59,-7,1,"Need more explanation about config format?"],["86cac8ef_5478c480",59,-7,1,"Add README.md for this directory?"],["a040ec86_1283e2f3",59,-7,1,"Write comment?"],["a1332edd_41ca4c15",59,-7,1,"Show link to how to install hyperfine?"],["479bc97f_f450a0f6",60,-2,1,"I think example is still not easy to understand how that controls benchmark behavior."],["9434a000_5e342d22",60,-2,0,"Updating os.environ here has some effect?"],["9d9bbffb_d26b0175",61,-2,1,"What kind of benchmark are we talking about here?"],["aedd703d_dd136bd8",60,-2,1,"Add explanation about where is base directory? Current directory or output directory?"],["b978b61f_37a00d63",60,-2,1,"What is benchmark name?"],["7347e257_388f0789",60,0,0,"If operation supported now is only add, it is fine to just use string or list instead of dict for config value?"]],0,176],[7171281,20412,7,0.248,0.173,[[87,1]],[],0,177],[7171338,20412,14,0.406,0.291,[[20,21]],[["fcad924a_8977545c",17,0,0,"nit: split('\\n\\n') might be easier to understand."]],0,178],[7171319,20413,183,3.856,3.092,[[87,2]],[["21ed0445_19956636",62,0,1,"Is there any meaning in this suffix?"],["39b0dff1_494526ee",62,0,0,"Now I understand why you need the proto. I guess you could add the proto file in this repository? I don't know how it works, though."],["5ad93ec5_20a407f0",62,0,1,"Is this a leftover?"],["807ef91e_ece77934",62,0,0,"I actually don't know this notation in Python, what does it do?"],["8bc66235_d509d243",62,0,0,"Hmm, I have an impression that there is a simpler way to query data without depending on Google internal tools. e.g. Pandas in Python https://pandas.pydata.org/"],["a475c9cf_1b491430",62,0,1,"